# Publish after every change

When a change to this project is finished, commit the files for that change and push `master` so https://roudic.github.io/kitchen-command/ updates. Do this without waiting to be asked again.

- Push `master`. GitHub Pages serves that branch.
- Leave out `grok-key.local`, other secrets, `functions/node_modules`, and unrelated untracked folders.
- Do not force-push.
